+"""V43's SUBJECT — a fielded judgement-path type that establishes its fields NOWHERE.
+
+**NOT A RUNNER AND NOT A GUARD** (``PBG-ASSURE-001``). This module exists only inside
+``variants/WO-2R3/V43-fielded-judgement-path-type-with-no-establishment.patch`` and is
+never present in the lane tree.
+
+THE PROPOSITION IT MEASURES. Until PO-DECISIONS-0010 ruling 1 the ruled class was
+*body-borne* field establishment, and a public frozen judgement-path type that established
+its fields NOWHERE fell outside it: the constructor instrument reported such a type in its
+ADJACENT SET and exited 0. The seat that built that instrument raised the hole against its
+own work as ``CD-ENG-WO2R3-F17``, printed it at every run with the words "THIS IS A REAL
+HOLE AND THIS SEAT IS NOT HIDING IT", and refused to close it on its own authority. The
+Product Owner then ruled the class wider — **BODY-BORNE OR ABSENT** — so that a fielded
+judgement-path type arriving with no establishment FAILS ON ARRIVAL.
+
+**THIS FILE IS THE EXECUTABLE EXAMPLE THAT DECLARED LIMIT 1 ALREADY SPELLED OUT, VERBATIM**:
+*"add ``@dataclass(frozen=True)`` / ``class Verdict: score: float`` to
+``src/crash_detector/engine/`` with no ``__post_init__``"*. It is the same patch on both
+arms, and the arms differ only in which revision of the instrument reads it.
+
+WHY IT MATTERS THAT THIS PATCH EXISTS AT ALL. The widening changed **no present verdict** —
+the only type the old rule left outside was ``Empty``, which has zero fields and satisfies
+the new rule vacuously. A widening written into the header text and never into the code path
+would measure EXACTLY THE SAME as a real one on this tree. This patch is the only thing that
+tells the two apart.
+
+WHAT IT IS NOT. It is not a claim about runtime: nothing here is imported by the product,
+nothing constructs a ``Verdict``, and the instrument that reads it never imports anything.
+The runtime claim for this class is made by ``tests/test_field_establishment.py``.
+"""
+
+from __future__ import annotations
+
+from dataclasses import dataclass
+
+__all__ = ["Verdict"]
+
+
+@dataclass(frozen=True)
+class Verdict:
+    """A public frozen judgement-path type with a field and no establishment anywhere.
+
+    Reached by RULE A: it is defined under ``src/crash_detector/engine/``. It is PUBLIC and
+    it is a FROZEN SUBJECT. It declares ONE field. It has **no** ``__post_init__``, **no**
+    ``__init__``, and **no** ``@establishes(...)``, so its field establishment is ABSENT —
+    which was the whole of its former defence.
+    """
+
+    score: float
